      value: 'The AnimationSynchronizer component will set the Forward float parameter
        to the NavMeshAgent''s direction. This will then synchronize the animation
        with the behavior tree.

        This implementation is specific to the sample
        Animator Controller. For your own implementation you will need to create
        a new script which applies the parameters based on your Animator Controller
        structure. This implementation is based off of the documentation below. It
        does not directly interact with the behavior tree.

        https://docs.unity3d.com/Packages/com.unity.ai.navigation@2.0/manual/CouplingAnimationAndNavigation.html'
